# Muting in the background (tools/check_audio.py): the game's window loses the
# focus (another window comes to the front), is minimized and restored (as
# Windows and X11 report it), and is covered and uncovered (as Wayland and
# macOS report a window minimized or on another workspace). Each time the sound
# must fade out into digital silence, stay silent until the window comes back
# (the command button and Esc pressed meanwhile make no sound: their effects
# are dropped) and fade back in, the music going on where it paused.
options --quick-start=Terran --seed=7 --open=none --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800 --audio
timeout 7200
wait-screen game
wait 300
window-event focus-lost
wait 40
click tag:command:research
wait 4
key Escape
wait 90
window-event focus-gained
wait 240
window-event focus-lost
window-event minimized
wait 150
window-event restored
window-event focus-gained
wait 240
window-event occluded
wait 120
window-event exposed
wait 300
